  unitName: Fire Spirit
  unitId: 10131
  unitNumber: 177
  description: A spirit that rules fire, one of the six elements created by the gods.
    The fire on its head is said to lead those who are lost and it is thought of
    as a protector of travelers.Conversely, it often appears at the scenes of fires,
    so some consider it an ill omen as well. Legend also speaks of its ability to
    awaken dormant power within others.
  summonDesc: I will go with you!<br>I've already decided!<br>I'm counting on you!
